*.pyc
__pycache__/
cpp/build/

# Conversion byproducts: rknn-toolkit2 dumps the ONNX graph at each of its
# internal optimisation stages into the CWD as `check<N>_<stage>.onnx`.  They are
# 35-75 MB each, are never read back, and are regenerated by every conversion.
check*.onnx

# Tool output.  It lives OUTSIDE this repository now (see paths.outputs()), so no
# code here can depend on a previous run's report.  This entry only catches an
# accidental local copy.
reports/
